 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Earth Manipulation — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to create large scale constructs. As an action for 4 cursed energy, you make a wall of stone. This wall is made of ten 10 foot by 10 foot panels that are 1 inch thick. Each panel must be touching at least one other panel. The wall has an AC equal to your cursed energy DC and a number of hit points equal to 10 times your CE modifier.</p>\n<p>You can spend 1 CE as a bonus action to move connected panels within 60 feet of you up to 30 feet in a direction of your choice that is in contact with the ground. If this movement would move a creature, they must make a Dexterity saving throw or be pushed by the wall.</p>",
